9a
) [
137
]. Although this substitution offers selectivity and precise targeting—with the choice of positions for the substituted Se in FeMoco allowing for selective interrogation of bridging interactions—the achievable energy resolution in conventional Se XAS is notably lower than that of S XAS, due to the significantly shorter 1
